00:25:59.720 --> 00:26:02.430
to really create an API
economy for just better

00:26:02.430 --> 00:26:04.250
business to business.

00:26:04.250 --> 00:26:07.130
And so we're not going to create
Apigee as a proprietary silo.

00:26:07.130 --> 00:26:09.088
We're actually looking,
like how do we actually

00:26:09.088 --> 00:26:11.670
integrate that, as we retool
that, into all of our currents

00:26:11.670 --> 00:26:12.830
we've around open source.

00:26:12.830 --> 00:26:16.230
So you'll be seeing a lot more
around microservices and APIs

00:26:16.230 --> 00:26:18.400
and endpoints emerging
