00:26:22.070 --> 00:26:23.460
five worlds converging.

00:26:23.460 --> 00:26:24.740
It's the cloud.

00:26:24.740 --> 00:26:25.980
It's open source.

00:26:25.980 --> 00:26:27.010
It's containers.

00:26:27.010 --> 00:26:29.400
It's these microservices
